%% Local inspection boundary; service-inspection.svg is the accessible publication layout.
flowchart LR
  accTitle: Inspect local service boundaries
  accDescr: RabbitMQ delivers UUID tasks to Celery while distinct authenticated local viewers inspect broker, task events, database rows and object storage. OpenObserve and clamdtop cover process and scanner diagnostics.
  Q["RabbitMQ quorum queue"] -->|"Business job-reference delivery"| W["Celery worker"]
  RM["RabbitMQ Management :15672<br/>lab_monitor · monitoring only"] -. "Queue / consumer metrics" .-> Q
  W -. "Task events via RabbitMQ" .-> F["Flower :5555<br/>Read-only task history"]
  PG["pgAdmin :5050<br/>lab_viewer · SELECT four tables"] -. "Read durable job / result" .-> DB["PostgreSQL business ledger"]
  SV["SeaweedFS admin :23646<br/>Read-only privileged operator"] -. "Cluster-wide filer reads" .-> OBJ["SeaweedFS originals<br/>Includes raw / quarantined bytes"]
  %% OpenObserve correlates API/relay/worker/provider events; clamdtop observes scanner queue/signatures.
  %% All web viewer listeners bind 127.0.0.1. Task SUCCESS does not imply comparison success.
